9", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499314641_2334058800454382_6810420958056556067_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=p56oe9hlJAkQ7kNvwE12jOz&_nc_oc=Adoe_-ZQC_nmz6KaQNFhbNdZX2QsIYE1PjJFDuLSOOfO6VOjiWATRmuYRIly7aob6Vc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTcfMnEMcfPJ7zO5YBpz-j0Dde74FWeJ8ntm3bdsIUeCw&oe=6AE8915B"}, {"file_name": "com.onenightcircus.fields-20251218-203353.png", "id": "1290753326156435", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499312236_1290753329489768_4332884711738293422_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=zeTTKD_d3JQQ7kNvwHJDzwh&_nc_oc=Adr48KgW484CrmcHBVlwpw_LYRFxCWqlspCuaAuNfxwwjxZqlc9Omw4E7s8ZqZvDNXQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTaLnFlz4O4DgZVRxV-wwfm7X4bIL_pl0PWPP7m7s82dQ&oe=6AE89101"}, {"file_name": "com.onenightcircus.fields-20251218-203201.png", "id": "1926405484733596", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499312338_1926405491400262_5342535590335345652_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=6GZR8ew7wOIQ7kNvwHKq4hq&_nc_oc=Adql7f1txyM2nIG1ZPEMNL_QAaEhFDDKYCDPF69lVt0kX8YmqHpm2jRTDDoPmzT6aEE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQQgRmD1hmn34iZkp4Lw9FjZPmAFTGILHopK17cm09iUg&oe=6AE8B51D"}, {"file_name": "com.onenightcircus.fields-20251218-203301.png", "id": "974613512240519", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499312470_974613515573852_1573452143751525995_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=cTuiV4vzdP4Q7kNvwFDgPxO&_nc_oc=AdoKqxeDlxyQnkyNTEjcO9KEv0ZYhl9FOnNoyBdbmO79neSPX6_3apWvR-BCUJvx3Ac&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQ2WKITQ6c5ZVqd5evtjV1l-xeLj2JGBy-AUoyT3U0UDw&oe=6AE8B6FF"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "fields-artwork-v2-2560x1440.png", "id": "1690141432030718", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499311597_1690141435364051_2132099073325899983_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=FpZOQivYDV0Q7kNvwGYnhqU&_nc_oc=AdpDvbFtGzbgr-86pY12-iR4inZxQEsJHhPYgNuClcnINuUhzLGdiMuLos-Kv-YXzG8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQREEZvTIHmG5rHDaiNXqgnDpm-0gsqys3W3Kn8YhVnzdA&oe=6AE8AB6E"}, "display_name": "Fields", "keywords": ["music", "inmersive", "art", "visuals", "meditation"], "long_description": "Fields is not an album you listen to. It is a place you enter.\n\nAn immersive VR experience built around the music of electronic producer Die Stadt, Fields dissolves the boundary between sound and space. Each track becomes an environment: shifting fields of light, generative textures, and slow chromatic movements that respond to the music in real time.\n\nFields is designed for deep listening \u2014 a rare kind of attention that VR makes possible. No narrative, no objectives. Only presence.\nWhat you will find inside:\n\n- A full-length electronic music album experienced as a living, breathing space.\n- Generative visuals that evolve with the music.\n- Designed for extended, contemplative sessions.\n- Optimized for Meta Quest 3.\n\nFields is an album. Fields is a place. Now you can enter both.\n\nStep in.\n{1548057873348580}", "short_description": "Step inside the music of electronic/ambient producer Die Stadt. Sound becomes space. Space becomes music."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "uba_APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE.png", "id": "2273186383217800", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499307451_2273186386551133_8686410893456982869_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Lb72s7jzSWgQ7kNvwGl4NDk&_nc_oc=Adp7tWpdX16eObi1FUBfxVyK9dSnZz9CTyYYTSQpaBRX8_p6scLoN-cbmsVzGVBgUeo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSAXyhxWCYfaQ9WqTEC_uD4cPlii07M6eHTopbCL2QZqw&oe=6AE8A45F"}, {"file_name": "fields_logotipo_512x512.png", "id": "2080711572861858", "image_type": "APP_IMG_L